msgid "The Nurevo service URL is not set. Open Nurevo AEO > Settings and check it under Advanced."
msgstr "URL usluge Nurevo nije postavljen. Otvorite Nurevo AEO > Postavke i provjerite ga pod Napredno."

#: wordpress-plugin/webmcp-canary/nurevo-webmcp.php:1963
msgid "The page text does not state your key facts, so AI has only your markup to go on."
msgstr "Tekst stranice ne navodi vaše ključne činjenice, pa se AI može osloniti samo na vaše oznake."

#: wordpress-plugin/webmcp-canary/nurevo-webmcp.php:2737
#: wordpress-plugin/webmcp-canary/nurevo-webmcp.php:2806
msgid "The pairing code is invalid or has expired."
msgstr "Kôd za uparivanje nije valjan ili je istekao."

#: wordpress-plugin/webmcp-canary/nurevo-webmcp.php:4335
msgid "The profile sync was rejected by the service."
msgstr "Usluga je odbila sinkronizaciju profila."

#: wordpress-plugin/webmcp-canary/nurevo-webmcp.php:1945
msgid "The raw HTML carries neither your content nor your schema, so crawlers that skip JavaScript see an empty page."
msgstr "Izvorni HTML ne sadrži ni vaš sadržaj ni schemu, pa indeksirajući botovi koji preskaču JavaScript vide praznu stranicu."

#: wordpress-plugin/webmcp-canary/nurevo-webmcp.php:5025
msgid "The service could not diagnose this site. This usually means it is not reachable from the internet yet - a local or password-protected site cannot be read."
msgstr "Usluga nije mogla dijagnosticirati ovu web-stranicu. To obično znači da još nije dostupna s interneta – lokalna web-stranica ili ona zaštićena lozinkom ne može se pročitati."

#: wordpress-plugin/webmcp-canary/nurevo-webmcp.php:4730
msgid "The trend appears once a second measurement has run."
msgstr "Trend će se prikazati nakon drugog mjerenja."

#: wordpress-plugin/webmcp-canary/nurevo-webmcp.php:3478
msgid "There is no site key to disable."
msgstr "Nema ključa web-stranice za onemogućavanje."

#: wordpress-plugin/webmcp-canary/nurevo-webmcp.php:3456
msgid "There is no site key to regenerate."
msgstr "Nema ključa web-stranice za ponovnu izradu."

#: wordpress-plugin/webmcp-canary/nurevo-webmcp.php:1225
msgid "These collect content to train AI models. They are not needed to appear in AI answers, so this is your choice."
msgstr "Oni prikupljaju sadržaj za učenje AI modela. Nisu potrebni za pojavljivanje u AI odgovorima, pa je izbor na vama."

#: wordpress-plugin/webmcp-canary/nurevo-webmcp.php:1207
msgid "These fetch your pages to answer and cite them. Your existing robots.txt rules, such as /wp-admin/, keep applying to them."
msgstr "Oni dohvaćaju vaše stranice kako bi odgovarali i citirali ih. Vaša postojeća pravila u robots.txt, poput /wp-admin/, i dalje se primjenjuju na njih."

#: wordpress-plugin/webmcp-canary/nurevo-webmcp.php:5010
msgid "These were inferred from your existing settings and published content. Only blank fields were filled, so please check that the values are right."
msgstr "Ove su vrijednosti zaključene iz vaših postojećih postavki i objavljenog sadržaja. Ispunjena su samo prazna polja, pa provjerite jesu li vrijednosti točne."

#: wordpress-plugin/webmcp-canary/nurevo-webmcp.php:2792
msgid "This code belongs to a site registered as %s. Pair it from that site, or correct the site address on the dashboard."
msgstr "Ovaj kôd pripada web-stranici registriranoj kao %s. Uparite ga s te web-stranice ili ispravite adresu web-stranice na nadzornoj ploči."

#: wordpress-plugin/webmcp-canary/nurevo-webmcp.php:4762
msgid "This is a beta feature. AI answers vary from run to run, so judge by the trend rather than any single result."
msgstr "Ovo je beta značajka. AI odgovori razlikuju se od pokretanja do pokretanja, pa procjenjujte prema trendu, a ne prema pojedinačnom rezultatu."

#: wordpress-plugin/webmcp-canary/nurevo-webmcp.php:5499
msgid "This is not a Nurevo AEO settings file."
msgstr "Ovo nije datoteka postavki za Nurevo AEO."

#: wordpress-plugin/webmcp-canary/nurevo-webmcp.php:2871
msgid "This license has no seats left. Release another site from the Nurevo dashboard, or use a license with more seats."
msgstr "Ova licenca nema više slobodnih mjesta. Oslobodite drugu web-stranicu na nadzornoj ploči Nurevo ili upotrijebite licencu s više mjesta."

#: wordpress-plugin/webmcp-canary/nurevo-webmcp.php:2874
msgid "This license is not attached to an account yet. Please contact Nurevo support."
msgstr "Ova licenca još nije povezana s računom. Obratite se podršci tvrtke Nurevo."

#: wordpress-plugin/webmcp-canary/nurevo-webmcp.php:449
msgid "This page’s own questions"
msgstr "Vlastita pitanja ove stranice"

#: wordpress-plugin/webmcp-canary/nurevo-webmcp.php:2797
msgid "This pairing code has already been used by another site. Issue a new one from the dashboard."
msgstr "Ovaj kôd za uparivanje već je upotrijebila druga web-stranica. Izdajte novi s nadzorne ploče."

#: wordpress-plugin/webmcp-canary/nurevo-webmcp.php:2877
msgid "This site has no public domain to register. A license can only be activated on a publicly reachable site."
msgstr "Ova web-stranica nema javnu domenu za registraciju. Licenca se može aktivirati samo na javno dostupnoj web-stranici."

#: wordpress-plugin/webmcp-canary/nurevo-webmcp.php:3412
msgid "This site is already registered. Regenerate the key with an administrator token if the existing key is unavailable."
msgstr "Ova je web-stranica već registrirana. Ako postojeći ključ nije dostupan, ponovno ga izradite pomoću administratorskog tokena."

#: wordpress-plugin/webmcp-canary/nurevo-webmcp.php:3502
#: wordpress-plugin/webmcp-canary/nurevo-webmcp.php:3602
msgid "This site is not connected to Nurevo yet. Open Nurevo AEO > Settings and pair it with a pairing code."
msgstr "Ova web-stranica još nije povezana s Nurevo. Otvorite Nurevo AEO > Postavke i uparite je pomoću kôda za uparivanje."

#: wordpress-plugin/webmcp-canary/nurevo-webmcp.php:3796
msgid "This site uses the Nurevo AEO plugin to publish structured data, llms.txt and AI crawler rules. These are produced on this site’s own server. By default the plugin adds no tracking script to public pages and sends no visitor data to the Nurevo service."
msgstr "Ova web-stranica koristi dodatak Nurevo AEO za objavu strukturiranih podataka, llms.txt i pravila za AI indeksirajuće botove. Oni se generiraju na vlastitom poslužitelju ove web-stranice. Prema zadanim postavkama dodatak ne dodaje skriptu za praćenje na javne stranice i ne šalje podatke o posjetiteljima usluzi Nurevo."

#: wordpress-plugin/webmcp-canary/nurevo-webmcp.php:3765
msgid "Tick the box to agree before running the diagnosis."
msgstr "Označite potvrdni okvir kako biste pristali prije pokretanja dijagnoze."

#: wordpress-plugin/webmcp-canary/nurevo-webmcp.php:2489
msgid "To publish the FAQ, place the %1$s block or the %2$s shortcode on the page where it should appear. The questions are shown there and published as FAQPage structured data on that page only; search engines accept FAQ markup only for questions visitors can read."
msgstr "Da biste objavili FAQ, postavite blok %1$s ili kratki kod %2$s na stranicu na kojoj se treba prikazati. Pitanja se ondje prikazuju i objavljuju kao FAQPage strukturirani podaci samo na toj stranici; tražilice prihvaćaju FAQ oznake samo za pitanja koja posjetitelji mogu pročitati."

#: wordpress-plugin/webmcp-canary/nurevo-webmcp.php:2880
msgid "Too many activation attempts. Please wait and try again."
msgstr "Previše pokušaja aktivacije. Pričekajte pa pokušajte ponovno."

#: wordpress-plugin/webmcp-canary/nurevo-webmcp.php:2803
msgid "Too many attempts. Please wait and try again."
