#: wordpress-plugin/webmcp-canary/nurevo-webmcp.php:4686
msgid "Your Pro plan is active. Measurement needs a site key and site ID to be configured."
msgstr "Vaš Pro paket je aktivan. Za mjerenje treba konfigurirati ključ web-stranice i ID web-stranice."

#: wordpress-plugin/webmcp-canary/nurevo-webmcp.php:1973
msgid "Your schema agrees with your page text and carries a freshness signal."
msgstr "Vaša schema podudara se s tekstom stranice i sadrži signal ažurnosti."

#: wordpress-plugin/webmcp-canary/nurevo-webmcp.php:1974
msgid "Your schema and page text disagree in places, or the freshness signal is missing."
msgstr "Vaša schema mjestimično se ne slaže s tekstom stranice ili nedostaje signal ažurnosti."

#: wordpress-plugin/webmcp-canary/nurevo-webmcp.php:1975
msgid "Your schema contradicts your page text, which makes AI distrust both."
msgstr "Vaša schema proturječi tekstu stranice, zbog čega AI ne vjeruje ni jednom ni drugom."

#: wordpress-plugin/webmcp-canary/nurevo-webmcp.php:3614
msgid "Your server could not look up the Nurevo service address. Ask your hosting provider whether outgoing connections are allowed."
msgstr "Vaš poslužitelj nije mogao pronaći adresu usluge Nurevo. Pitajte svog pružatelja usluge udomljavanja jesu li odlazne veze dopuštene."

#: wordpress-plugin/webmcp-canary/nurevo-webmcp.php:3617
msgid "Your server could not verify the Nurevo service’s security certificate. Ask your hosting provider to update the server’s certificate store."
msgstr "Vaš poslužitelj nije mogao provjeriti sigurnosni certifikat usluge Nurevo. Zamolite svog pružatelja usluge udomljavanja da ažurira spremište certifikata poslužitelja."

#: wordpress-plugin/webmcp-canary/nurevo-webmcp.php:4169
msgid "Your site now follows central ruleset v%2$d (was v%1$d). The diagnosis was re-run against the new criteria."
msgstr "Vaša web-stranica sada prati središnji skup pravila v%2$d (prije v%1$d). Dijagnoza je ponovno pokrenuta prema novim kriterijima."
